ft0TjzmCMo3bQFn2AzQoM08X1uPjZiJMjBX8FT2iVdcSw&oe=69A2C7E1"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1061517104420269", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_1061517107753602_1383467785716530594_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B-L-3ekVvisQ7kNvwGh1bsQ&_nc_oc=AdmlHbeMsD6Q92k9aERbtcP_5IM5qplSkTDWbscUmvFELGnPLeB7ywBOJFqLJ4yxwmQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvl2T6LINsvMXCfCX6LYVaDQBanLwt0YZQohXk5MEmu3w&oe=69A2D775"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot 2022-07-03 20ffff1916.png", "id": "3478847289006005", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974897_3478847295672671_208656237028816676_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gzd0hJibqXIQ7kNvwHGg1I9&_nc_oc=Adk5zehu0nDCPYr-VOlmJpLMqHIjEF18bul-xxqLqW4mCZaYN4KJhY-Vsx3sUOaiv2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvoh8mTC_ghbjomxvt70aE9-wPxBhCP4ZiJaKCkKdCLnA&oe=69A2E3E0"}, "display_name": "Blockies VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Blockies VR is a single player action-puzzle game where you knock down block buildings and protect friendly Blockies against the forces of evil. Launch a wide range of objects at enemies in this low-poly physics world. Travel to the Kingdom\u2019s shop to expand your weapon arsenal to take on the most difficult puzzles in all the land.\n\nFeatures\n-A dozen types of blocks that interact uniquely with the world\n-A dozen AI enemy types each with their own abilities\n-Levels where you must defend the Blockies from monster attacks\n-Levels with intricate block puzzles to solve\n-The Kingdom where cool new projectiles can be purchased\n-Beautifully designed low poly environments\n-At least 50 levels by full release (Currently 16)\n-With enough support: Level Editor to create and share new levels\n-With enough support: Co-op and Multiplayer Functionality\n\nJoin the Discord to learn more about future updates, and provide your own feedback of what 